# At any depth: a bare `node_modules/` only matched the root one, so server/ and
# desktop/ (450 MB, plus host-ABI native binaries) were being sent to the daemon
# on every build and could have overwritten the image's own `npm ci` output.
**/node_modules/
dist/
desktop/release/
.git/
.claude/
data/database.sqlite
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
backups/
screenshots/
*.log

# Local artifacts (gitignored) that would otherwise bloat the build context
.playwright-mcp/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.DS_Store
/*.png
/*-snapshot.md
/*-refs.md
AUDIT.md
FEATURES.md
BACKLOG.md
# Tests are never shipped and some reach into server/ — exclude them at any depth
# so the image build doesn't compile them (the bare `*.test.ts` only matched root).
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
